    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89378.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. Well, if he, uh, the report is, is, you know, I, they call it the Mueller report. I call it the Mueller dossier. If you look at both part one and part two or volume one, volume two, it's an embarrassment. Probably the most notable embarrassment is that compared to the House Republican Intelligence Report where we make 40-some recommendations as to what needs to be done to make sure that we protect our voting systems and voting election integrity, that should be first and foremost top of, you know, Mueller's list of what he should have done because he was supposed to look into",
