        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts the findings and priorities of the House Republican Intelligence Report more than those of the Mueller report.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a clear standard for evaluating investigative reports based on their actionable recommendations.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the term 'dossier' as a more accurate description of the Mueller report than 'report', implying bias or lack of credibility.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Election integrity is a primary responsibility of federal investigations involving foreign interference.",
