  {
    "episode_id": 89378,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89378.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "Now the American people, if you really understand this, what I call the Russiagate hoax, you now know that this was actually set up to be an obstruction of justice trap. And what they were really doing for the better part of the entire investigation was just trying to catch the president. in an obstruction of justice",
