    "turn_idx": 48,
    "turn_text": "Well, our guess is they never thought they were going to get caught. So one of the keys to this whole investigation is And important for the American people to understand this key point of all the points. There's nothing wrong with a campaign, a political campaign being put under investigation. It happens not all the time, but it happens. But it's criminal in nature. So if someone mispent campaign funds, for",
